# Candidate IDs, not provider-authored numeric indices, bind captured suggestions. An inconsistent association uses the existing full-proposal repair instead of freezing other arrays.
# One malformed-output repair is shared by both roles. An isolated proposer record uses private transient proposal custody; no malformed reply is persisted or logged. Other rows stay pinned, and complete native validation and independent verification precede action admission. [src: src/review-actions.ts]
